  "prefLabel": "He-P 4024.12 Requirement to Use Peak Annual TEDE",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4024.12 Requirement to Use Peak Annual TEDE. When calculating TEDE to the average member of the critical group, the licensee shall determine the peak annual TEDE dose expected within the first 1000 years after decommissioning.\n\nSource. #8393, eff 7-23-05; ss by #10492, eff 12-24-13; ss by #13997, eff 6-12-24",
